  "notes": "A compound of {速|そく} (fast) + {報|ほう} (report). Commonly seen on TV and smartphone notifications for urgent news.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ニュース{速報|そくほう} (news flash)\n- {地震|じしん}{速報|そくほう} (earthquake bulletin)\n- {選挙|せんきょ}{速報|そくほう} (election flash report)\n- {速報|そくほう}が{入|はい}る (a bulletin comes in)\n- {速報|そくほう}{値|ち} (preliminary figures)\n\nIn Japan, {緊急地震速報|きんきゅうじしんそくほう} (Emergency Earthquake Early Warning) is a well-known system that sends alerts to phones before shaking arrives.",
